			description: [
				"Is a vanilla bee farm hard to make for honeycombs to make GT bees?"
				"Luckily there is a solution to get you ridiculous amounts of honeycombs and honey. This TNT spawns an entire giant bee colony made of honey and honeycomb blocks with bees and beehives inside. It simply requires some initial investment of honey and combs in the crafting recipe."
				""
				"A disadvantage of this method is that you have to destroy the honey and honeycomb blocks manually; think of it like a charcoal pile igniter-like block that gets you results quickly at the cost of manual work."
